-# CRW-10: what happens to the chosen photos, and a second try when they did not reach the server.
%p.photo-status{ role: "status", data: { photo_target: "status" } }
%button.button.button-secondary.button-small{ type: "button", hidden: true,
  data: { photo_target: "again", action: "photo#again" } } Send again
